<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Nightmare Creatures · Decompilation progress</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;background:#f6f3ed;color:#242321;font:16px/1.55 "Source Sans 3",system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:960px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(24px,5vw,64px) 20px} header{border-top:4px solid #9c332e;padding-top:18px}
header p,footer,p.note{color:#57534c} header p,h1,h2,dl,dd{margin:0}
h1,h2,.rate{font-family:"Source Serif 4",Georgia,serif} h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.1}
h2{font-size:1.45rem;margin:2rem 0 .7rem} .rate{font-size:clamp(3rem,9vw,5rem);color:#91332e;line-height:1.2}
progress{display:block;width:100%;height:.7rem;accent-color:#91332e;margin:10px 0 24px}
dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:16px;border-block:1px solid #cfc9bc;padding:18px 0}
dd,td{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} dd{font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:600} dt{font-size:.9rem}
.scroll{overflow-x:auto} table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;white-space:nowrap}
th,td{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d3c9;text-align:right} th:first-child{text-align:left}
thead th{font-size:.86rem} tbody th{font-weight:500} footer{margin-top:2rem;font-size:.9rem} code{color:#7a2926}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main><header><p>Nightmare Creatures · US PlayStation release</p><h1>Decompilation progress</h1></header>
<h2>Original instructions in handwritten C</h2><strong class="rate">$percent%</strong>
<progress aria-label="Handwritten instruction coverage" value="$done" max="$total">$percent%</progress>
<dl><div><dt>Original lines</dt><dd>$total_label</dd></div><div><dt>Decompiled</dt><dd>$done_label</dd></div>
<div><dt>Remaining</dt><dd>$remaining</dd></div><div><dt>Project files</dt><dd>$project_files</dd></div></dl>
<h2>By executable</h2><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Game file</th><th>Original lines</th>
<th>Decompiled</th><th>Remaining</th><th>Complete</th></tr></thead><tbody>$rows</tbody></table></div>
<p class="note">Each line represents one decoded instruction in the $modules executables.
Each address counts once per executable. The project coverage register credits $sources handwritten C files
toward completion. Generated C, data directives and port infrastructure are excluded, as are
$padding alignment-padding <code>nop</code>s that follow a function's final jump and its delay slot.</p>
<p class="note">Project files include existing tracked and non-ignored untracked files in this checkout.
A dash indicates that Git inventory is unavailable.</p>
<footer>Updated $updated · Refresh with <code>make state</code> after updating
<code>config/decomp_ranges.txt</code>. <code>make recomp</code> also refreshes this page.</footer></main>
</body>
</html>
